<title>UK: City Site sells UK offices to MEPC.</title>
<headline>City Site sells UK offices to MEPC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property company City Site Estates Plc said on Friday it had sold its long leasehold interest in a Birmingham office property to MEPC Plc for 30 million stg.</p>
</text>
